WEBVTT

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:18.780
We're back under the skies of Windermere, Father.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:25.940
<i>Our kiss will send us leaping to the edge of space</i>

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:30.370
<i>Our affection is too hot for mere passionate love</i>

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:35.220
<i>We can be in absolute zero</i>

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:50.020
<i>I'll spark a dream in you</i>

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:54.540
<i>I'll embrace all you believe in</i>

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:57.160
<i>Let your genes go wild</i>

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:04.040
<i>I love you so much, but I try to play it cool sometimes</i>

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:07.890
<i>Tear off my mask and squeeze me to a whole new dimension</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:14.860
<i>By banging into each other, we confirm our uncovered love</i>

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:19.260
<i>The tears we can't cry on our own connect us to the future</i>

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:25.880
<i>Our passionate love will shoot us into a super nova-like state</i>

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:31.770
<i>We can do this! No wounds can hold us back if we're together</i>

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:34.490
<i>Show me your passion, pray to the skies</i>

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:37.860
<i>Our super big bang will breathe life into a new genesis</i>

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:41.120
<i>We burn our lives for this fusion</i>

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:46.600
<i>We are in absolute zero</i>

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:07.200
May you return to the wind you came from.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:23.130
So you all came.

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:26.840
We felt we should come here before the coronation.

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:27.710
What about Bogue?

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:31.060
He said he wanted to see his family.

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:32.460
I see.

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:34.940
So he went to see them.

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:38.250
Father.

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:39.720
Mother.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:40.930
Vila.

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:42.130
Anne.

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:43.030
Herne.

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:46.630
The end is approaching.

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:56.220
It has been 150 years since a Wind Singer became king.

00:02:56.220 --> 00:03:00.570
I heard Lord Roid will declare the globular cluster's independence at the coronation.

00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:04.240
It's taken longer than I hoped.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:10.080
Indeed. Seven years ago, we 
failed to protect these skies.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:13.850
We lost so many that even Lord Roid and Lord Keith—

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:18.010
not even full-fledged knights at 
the time—had to join the fight.

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:23.970
That war took their white wings and tainted them black.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:27.890
We fought like cowards, resorting to using the Var.

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:30.480
Conduct unbefitting of knights.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:36.090
But now we're in a better position to negotiate with the UN Government.

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:39.510
Just leave it to Lord Roid. He'll make things right.

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:42.700
So far, everything has gone according to his plan.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:47.460
He realized that His Highness' songs could control the Var

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:50.580
and figured out how to use the ruins to that end.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.860
He's truly a sage of the wind.

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:57.940
I recall <i>someone</i> claiming how much of a waste of time his methods were.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:59.630
I just...

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:06.010
Looks like we owe him an apology and should be willing to accept any punishment.

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:10.140
Oh, right. Have you gone to see your son yet?

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.320
He's 6 now, right?

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.650
I haven't gone to see my family yet.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:19.670
But why? You had the time.

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:22.300
Theo hasn't gone to see his fiancée either.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:22.950
Xao!

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:27.410
We don't know what stance NUNS will take.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:33.830
I vowed to forget my family until the war is over.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.880
That's ridiculous. Go see them.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:40.840
I already have. My second grandchild is on his way.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:41.890
The second?!

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:43.090
That's great news!

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.410
I must visit him once he's born.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:48.360
I won't take back-talking from anyone.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:51.220
Remember this.

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:57.190
War or not, our lives may end at any moment.

00:04:57.700 --> 00:05:02.610
So say what you want to say 
and do what you want to do.

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:05.640
If you want to see someone, go to them.

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:27.390
Have your wounds healed?

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:29.480
It was no big deal.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:33.470
It's hard to believe one of them managed to get to you.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.810
It's been a while since I last felt a wind like that.

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.590
The day has finally come.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:47.780
You opposed me that day when I said I'd fold my wings.

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:53.640
However, you understood it 
was all for the sake of victory.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:59.510
Your white wings then turned to black.

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:04.050
Get to the point.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:09.240
If we go down this path, we can 
only expect the unexpected.

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:13.560
Still, will you support me?

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:17.040
I only follow the wind.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:20.320
As long as you stay true to the winds of Windermere,

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:22.520
my duty remains the same.

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:24.390
I see.

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:27.280
Forgive me, Keith.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:32.370
We must do what we must 
before our lives comes to an end.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:51.180
White Knight!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.180
It warms my heart to see you well.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:58.480
It's time for us to greet His Highness.

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:10.110
It's Prince Heinz!

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:11.900
Prince Heinz!

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:28.940
Sir Hermann Klaus.

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:31.310
Sir Cassim Ebelhart.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:32.720
Sir Bogue Con-Vaart.

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.630
Sir Theo Jussila.

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:37.180
Sir Xao Jussila.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:42.800
I thank you for your deeds in the name of my late father.

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:47.630
I expect you to continue your exemplary service to me and to Windermere.

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:48.520
Your Highness!

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:54.560
He really has matured a lot.

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:57.410
I am happy to see that he has.

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:00.910
Lord Keith is the son of a concubine, right?

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:04.750
He became a knight to protect his brother.

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:07.350
Those siblings really do care for each other.

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:11.290
I am glad to see that you are fine.

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:13.920
I apologize for my failings.

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:15.550
Can you fly again?

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:18.760
I have no difficulties calling upon the wind.

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:25.110
I see. Without you, these skies might not be ours today.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.470
Could we...

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:33.280
...work together as brothers from now on?

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:39.460
I wish you would walk down 
this path with me as my brother.

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:44.420
I have always adored how you fly.

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:50.710
It only took once glance to recognize your majestic and beautiful flight.

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:57.220
Knowing that you were fighting on the battlefield was my greatest support.

00:08:58.330 --> 00:08:59.150
Which is why—

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:00.930
I am a knight.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:05.350
Protecting the skies and the 
wind of this land is my duty.

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:08.310
I see.

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:12.720
This shall be the last time I address you as a sibling,

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.210
my dear brother Keith.

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:22.350
I entrust you with the skies of Windermere,

00:09:23.190 --> 00:09:25.160
Keith Aero Windermere.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:25.870
Your Highness.

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:36.970
It's unusual for you to call me.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:40.640
How goes the effort to reclaim the cluster?

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:44.550
The meetings are endless, yet little progress is made.

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:46.990
Why do you ask?

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:48.650
I might know of a way.

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:50.150
Huh?

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:59.570
You evacuated with the entire restaurant?

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:02.960
This will be our room starting from today.

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:05.250
It used to be Chuck's.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.790
My turf. No trespassing.

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:10.250
Querule?

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:12.730
There was a bath in here?!

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:15.880
Come on. It's a Ragnan bed.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:16.910
A bed?

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:18.220
Guys!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.590
You won't believe this! Just look!

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:25.060
The same video broadcast is overriding all channels.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.600
That means...

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:28.810
They took over the galactic network?

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:32.490
I know this castle!

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:34.510
It's from Windermere?

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:38.490
Yes. They're broadcasting real time to the entire galaxy.

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:05.930
Windermere has never, even for a moment, forgotten the shame of that day.

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:13.190
For seven long years, we tried to tell the truth to the galaxy.

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:19.740
However, the gargantuan might of the UN Government has crushed our voices.

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.820
We have waited. We have persisted.

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:31.500
Led by the Wind Singer and King Gramia 
Nehrich Windermere, we rose at long last!

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:38.180
To our great grief, King Gramia has 
returned to the wind during the last battle.

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:46.430
However, in a final blaze of glory, we were able to liberate the globular cluster.

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:49.680
The Starwind sector has been established!

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:53.480
In honor of our late king, I shall declare

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:55.810
that our cause is just!

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.610
This is the proof!

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:00.960
What's this?

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:02.570
Surveillance satellite footage?

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:06.490
No way...

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:11.460
A VF-22. It's a NUNS special ops unit.

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:15.170
But what's that at the bottom?

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:31.760
What was that?

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:33.260
A dimensional weapon.

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:36.480
NUNS used a dimensional weapon?

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:43.650
The NUN Spacy defiled our 
land with a dimensional weapon.

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:50.820
To conceal this, they blamed us for the genocide and withdrew.

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:53.960
They kept manipulating the media ever since.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:58.590
Furthermore, they still intend 
to conquer the entire galaxy!

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:07.010
Nothing makes this more clear than their decision to use a reaction bomb during the battle of Ragna!

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:13.640
To ensure our victory, we must 
crush the core of UN Government!

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:15.440
What?!

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:18.920
We will keep expanding the Starwind sector,

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:21.030
advance towards the core of the galaxy,

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:23.710
and defeat the UN Government.

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:26.990
As the rightful heirs to the Protoculture,

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:29.960
we shall accomplish what they failed to do 500 thousand years ago

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:32.450
and establish the great galactic civilization!

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:40.750
This is a war to free the galaxy from the 
oppression of the Earthlings and their allies!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:44.470
Soar now, my winged brothers and sisters!

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:46.380
What's going on?

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:48.640
I thought the war was ending.

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:52.640
This is King Gramia's last will.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:14:00.140
In the moments before his wings fell, he entrusted me with his commands.

00:14:00.140 --> 00:14:03.360
I swore upon my rune that 
I would finish what he started.

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:05.340
What is he saying?

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:07.210
It's as Lord Roid says!

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:08.910
We'll crush the UN Government!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:12.950
We won't be ruled by folks who have no wings to fly!

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:20.920
And the king who shall rule the civilization we build

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:26.920
is King Heinz Nehrich Windermere!

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:28.980
King Heinz!

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:45.200
Long live His Majesty Heinz!

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:50.740
My father has always wished for the happiness of the people of Windermere. For all of you here.

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:54.350
I swear on the name of my father and the Great Wind!

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:59.150
I shall devote my life to Windermere 
and work for my people.

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:02.710
I shall bring peace to my country—

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:06.260
Nay, to the entire galaxy!

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:10.970
Rudanjal Rom Mayan!

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.200
He's singing?

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:30.570
It's the song of the wind!

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:32.030
King Heinz?

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:33.990
The Wind Singer.

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:43.080
This is the song of the wind?

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:47.800
What's that?

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:10.190
Giant structures similar to the one on Ragna have appeared at every ruin location!

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:14.990
We are detecting weak bio-fold waves throughout the galaxy.

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:18.620
What's going on?!

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:22.810
It's not enough to trigger the Var yet.

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:26.630
But if his singing got any stronger...

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:33.530
Not only the globular cluster, but the entire galaxy would fall under Windermere mind control.

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:35.880
But...

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:42.020
I've seen this before...

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:47.780
But how?

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:09.340
Lord Roid.

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:11.960
What is it?

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:14.540
A NUNS fleet is approaching.

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:15.570
I see.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:19.930
Fools.

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:24.280
The song of the wind?

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:26.040
What's happening with the bio-fold waves?!

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:29.270
Getting stronger as we approach the globular cluster.

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:31.400
What about our new fold jamming?!

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:34.830
It's operating.

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:36.440
Fold signals detected!

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:38.870
Something's de-folding!

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.260
Here they come.

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:42.330
All units, prepare to engage!

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:54.080
We've got visuals on the enemy scouting fleet.

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:56.590
Your rune's dimmed, Cassim!

00:17:57.510 --> 00:18:02.760
What Roid said might not be to your liking, but you've got a mission to focus on right now!

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:05.660
My apologies.

00:18:08.510 --> 00:18:12.070
How are they still moving while the song of the wind is being sung?

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:15.900
Seven fold jammer vessels detected.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:20.060
How pretentious! They intend to 
disrupt His Majesty Heinz's voice?

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:21.580
Laughable.

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:24.540
White Knight?

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:29.000
One unit broke away and is approaching rapidly!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.540
All defensive units, prepare to engage!

00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:48.860
The enemy dodged all the drone bombs!

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:49.510
Incoming!

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:50.410
Impossible!

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:51.020
What?

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:53.570
He got past!

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:56.370
All units, reverse! Take the bastard down!

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:57.650
Roger!

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:06.250
I can see the wind!

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:22.740
Wow.

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:24.690
My rune has never shone brighter!

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:27.680
His Majesty Heinz's voice has gotten stronger!

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:31.960
He lost an eye, but his rune's gotten even stronger?

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:33.990
Ah, I know that way of flying.

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:50.710
Fold jamming down to 15.7%.

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:52.920
Impossible! Just a single unit?

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:15.270
This is terrible.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.730
Delta 1, situation?

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:21.130
We've reached the location of the emergency beacon.

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:22.630
We didn't make it on time.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:27.410
What's that?

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:30.580
This is Delta 4. I found a survivor!

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:31.740
Commencing rescue!

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:44.800
I fight for the sake of Windermere 
and of these skies, Father.

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:50.650
The ruins are operating normally on all planets.

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:53.360
Now we only need to increase the output.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.230
I see.

00:20:55.820 --> 00:21:00.640
That aside, it was brought to my attention that 
there has been a request for peace negotiations.

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:03.280
I hear you turned them down.

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:07.490
The UN Government is just after the ruins.

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:13.510
They have no rightful claim to the Protoculture's legacy.

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:16.660
Mission 15: Parting Resolution

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:39.900
<i>I stand on the burning wreckage</i>

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:46.620
<i>I don't know for how long or why at all</i>

00:21:46.620 --> 00:21:51.380
<i>The flames around are drowning me</i>

00:21:51.380 --> 00:21:57.880
<i>Finding what I seek feels so pointless now</i>

00:21:57.880 --> 00:22:03.630
<i>Break the world and go beyond the ecstasy of the past</i>

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:10.010
<i>Choose the future even if it's the inferior option</i>

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:10.970
<i>Let's go</i>

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:13.980
<i>Love forever until the very end</i>

00:22:13.980 --> 00:22:16.900
<i>Sing so hard until it hurts</i>

00:22:16.900 --> 00:22:22.690
<i>Until your soul finally settles down</i>

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:25.600
<i>But if you still want to sing then</i>

00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:28.430
<i>If you want to bet all on living</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:34.250
<i>The purity of your heart will destroy everything</i>

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:39.200
<i>Ah, believe in me, baby</i>

00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:45.930
<i>I'll forgive you in a chaotic climax</i>

00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:49.590
Is that you, Robert Kino?!

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:54.060
Arad? Arad Molders?

00:22:54.320 --> 00:22:55.930
You know him?

00:22:55.930 --> 00:22:57.360
Kinda.

00:22:57.360 --> 00:22:58.310
What happened?

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:00.940
It was over in a flash.

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:04.230
A single Draken just blew past us like the wind...

00:23:04.480 --> 00:23:05.860
The White Knight.

00:23:07.230 --> 00:23:08.920
Don't speak anymore.

00:23:08.920 --> 00:23:10.720
Take him to the infirmary.

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:11.910
Wait.

00:23:12.590 --> 00:23:14.830
You saved me.

00:23:14.830 --> 00:23:15.870
What's your name?

00:23:16.780 --> 00:23:19.040
Hayate. Hayate Immelmann.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:21.650
Immelmann?

00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:24.750
As in Wright Immelmann?

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:27.290
You knew my father?

00:23:28.680 --> 00:23:33.180
Arad, why are you with the son of that man?

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:39.600
Next time: Hesitating Birthday
